WEBVTT

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.430
She will, without doubt, fall to that city.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.470
All is as fate decrees.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:31.420
And the cycle of fate is in my hands.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.300
Yes, master.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.870
Hello? Mr. Kuro?

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.280
My cat's gone missing again.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.770
Mr. Daijuji!

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:18.190
You haven't paid your rent in four months!

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:24.100
I think I have a wrong number!

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.260
I'm sorry!

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:32.450
Hello, this is the Daijuji Detective Office!

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:34.940
This is Mr. Daijuji's office, yes?

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:39.440
I have an important, as well as
high-paying, job for you—

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.200
Hello?

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.650
This is Daijuji!

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.160
So you're in?

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.390
What's the job?

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:49.450
Could we discuss the details in person?

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.860
I've sent a messenger.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.990
A messenger?

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:55.980
Please look outside your window.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:04.250
Mr. Daijuji, please watch your step.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.900
R-Right...

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.820
I thank you for coming.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.670
Mr. Kuro Daijuji.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:30.250
The Hado Foundation's members are
Arkham City's de facto rulers.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.130
What do they want with an odd-jobs man
from the bad part of town?

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.700
Please discuss that with the mistress herself.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.040
The mistress?

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:46.040
This is a job for you and you
alone, Mr. Kuro Daijuji.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:49.410
I haven't introduced myself, have I?

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.710
I am Ruri Hado.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.390
And this is my butler, Winfield.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.620
H-Hado...

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.990
Which means... No way!

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:08.270
S-So... What is the job?

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.400
I'd like you to find a grimoire.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:18.510
One with power, one that
real mages would use.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.510
A grimoire?

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.340
Grimoires are,

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.410
almost without exception,
collections of blasphemous knowledge.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.830
No one on the up-and-up needs one.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:30.840
And often, it's the underworld mobs

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:33.020
that run anything having to do with magic.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.910
If the Black Lodge or someone came after me,

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.010
I wouldn't stand a chance.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:41.900
So we'll pay you accordingly.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.900
Will you accept the job, Mr. Daijuji?

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.570
This will cover your fee and expenses, to start.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.110
I'll take it!

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:53.580
Thank you, Mr. Daijuji.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.480
Leave it to me!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:01.540
So you see, I got a big job
and a big up-front fee!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.240
The world's not so bad, after all.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.260
I see.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.620
I'm glad to hear it.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.360
Aren't you, though?

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.260
But, Kuro...

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.360
What is it, Raika?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.870
You got a big job, right?

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:17.600
Then why, oh why, are you here,

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.740
eating my food, without paying?

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.740
Habit, I guess...

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.100
The habits of poverty, ground into me,

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.190
won't go away that easily.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.370
I see.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.380
I understand.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.820
Then would you be willing to pay me back

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.320
for all the food you've eaten?

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.190
S-Sure?

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.120
And I'd like it if you could make a donation

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.930
to the church, as well.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.500
S-Sure?

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.070
Thank you, Kuro.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:57.510
And so, I'll take the rest of the money.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.170
Take care of it...

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.840
No...

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:03.870
Kuro!

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.800
What are you doing?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.850
How long are you going to flirt with Raika?

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.980
Are you here for free food again?

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.220
What?

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:12.710
That's not true today.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.990
Right, Raika?

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.150
What are you talking about?

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.310
Do you know, Alison?

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.840
I don't know.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.800
Brother Kuro?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.620
Why is this happening?!

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:26.940
You'd use all the money right away.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:29.140
If you need it, I'll give it to you.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.680
I need it now!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.540
No.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.010
Thanks to Kuro, we'll have a feast tonight.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.540
Everyone, say thanks!

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:38.590
All right!

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:39.550
Thank you, Kuro!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:42.150
Bye!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.700
Bye...

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.860
Was asking him really a good idea?

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:55.030
Mistress, he may have dropped out,

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:59.370
but he did study the occult
at Miskatonic University.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:03.510
In other words, magical theory.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:06.340
The existence of Miskatonic's Department
of Occult Studies

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.660
is not public knowledge.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:13.530
And its students are never allowed
to reveal themselves.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:18.720
Tracking down any of them is a nightmare.
Finding Mr. Kuro Daijuji was trouble enough.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.630
For now, he's our only hope.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.360
Demonbane...

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:28.730
Our one way to fight the Black Lodge,
left to us by my grandfather.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:32.480
We need a grimoire for it, no matter what.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.590
A powerful, magical grimoire...

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:42.120
No matter how many rare and
occult bookstores I hit,

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.010
I guess I'll never find a grimoire.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:55.260
Now then... What to do?

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.030
Huh?

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:04.510
<i>Was there a bookstore here?</i>

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.610
<i>No way...</i>

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:18.750
This is...

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.050
You...

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.790
Are you looking for something?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.290
Y-Yes, I suppose so.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:33.160
If you like, I'll help you find a book.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:36.570
Excuse me, I didn't introduce myself.

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:39.520
I'm the owner of this bookstore. My name is...

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:43.170
Just call me Nya.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.780
Thank you for your patronage.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.230
H-Hi.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.780
Kuro Daijuji.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.880
So, what are you looking for?

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:56.890
Well, I'm looking for something a little special.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:00.620
Like a powerful, magical grimoire?

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.030
How could you tell?

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:04.170
It's nothing special.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.360
You see, when you run a bookstore
for a long time,

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:09.980
you learn what kinds of
books people are after.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:14.790
Especially those who are after grimoires...
They're quite unique.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:18.710
No, it's not me who needs the grimoire.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.710
This very minute, this grimoire
might be calling for someone...

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.380
That's the <i>Liber Loagaeth</i>!

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:27.930
It's the real thing.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.320
It possesses an awesome power.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.240
Don't you think, it's not unlikely

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.230
that a book like this has its own soul or mind?

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:37.700
Ma'am, would you sell me that book?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.720
I can't do that.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:44.900
The book you need isn't here.

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.600
What do you mean?

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.840
There's a grimoire meant especially for you.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.610
You just don't know it yet.

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:59.870
In the new future, you'll hold it for yourself.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.850
The most powerful of the grimoires...

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.490
The ultimate grimoire, capable
of summoning a god.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.450
<i>I can't wait...</i>

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.270
<i>What kind of grimoire will be yours?</i>

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:35.420
<i>Perhaps it may even be
the famous Necronomicon.</i>

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.620
She absolutely refused to sell it to me.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.930
Move!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.330
Get out of the way!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.740
I said move!

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.340
You fool!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.770
Wh-What's wrong with you?

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:02.770
Fool! Fool!

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.640
You colossal fool!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:09.320
Not many people expect to
see girls, falling from the sky...

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:12.560
Black Lodge?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.790
Why?

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:16.230
Thanks to you, they caught up with me!

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:18.800
Wait a second!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.030
I have nothing to do with this!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:23.620
I said wait!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.190
Wh-Why am I alive...

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.560
Magic?

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:51.260
Fly, blasphemers!

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:02.770
I wasted too much of my power...

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:04.880
A-Amazing.

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:09.360
Hey, are you okay?

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.420
I knew it. Without a caster, I...

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.350
Hey!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:15.050
Wh-What?

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.920
Who is this girl?

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:20.420
Jeez... What's going on?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.760
You, young one.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:28.530
Hand that girl over to me, quietly.

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:31.500
Um, who might you be?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.290
Wh-Wh-Wh-What?

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.740
You don't know the name
of the great Doctor West,

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:41.250
greatest genius of the past
hundred million years?!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.430
What ignorance!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.320
Ignorance is a sin!

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.520
Ignorance is a tragedy!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.880
U-Uh...

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:50.290
That said, young one,
if you insist on getting in my way...

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:53.230
Dying to fuel the advancement of
myself and the Black Lodge

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.520
is your much better choice!

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:58.860
By overcoming your death,
I grew up, just a little.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.270
Farewell, my youth.

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:02.600
Farewell, a summer's gentle love...

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.540
Okay!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:07.070
I'm Rock and Roll!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.810
Let's play!

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.650
What is that?!

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.180
Fire!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:17.920
Hey!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.880
What?

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.390
I won't let you get away.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:29.360
Everything... Everything is for
the glory of the Black Lodge...

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:34.130
And for the glorious exploits
of myself, Doctor West!

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:42.510
You awake?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.980
You saved me?

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:48.250
I've got nothing to do with this,
but I couldn't leave you there.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.050
I see.

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:51.620
I thank you.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:02.990
Are you really sure you don't
need to go to a hospital?

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.280
I'm fine.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.160
I don't want to cause you any more trouble.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.200
Wh-What?

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:17.340
You smell of black darkness.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.910
Are you a mage?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.160
I'm just a dabbler.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.280
And you?

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:32.290
I see. If you're not a mage,
then you don't have a book...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.710
Excellent.

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:36.550
From what I can see,
you seem to have considerable potential.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:38.090
What luck!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.460
Of course, a coincidence like this

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.980
does make me wonder if someone's
manipulating me...

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.840
Um... Hello?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:14:00.540
You may have thought you'd hidden yourselves,

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:05.920
but it is impossible to hide from
the great genius Doctor West.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:09.100
Weep tears made from a subtle
and delicate blend

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:13.130
of regret at your own stupidity, and surrender!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.570
Damn!

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:16.820
That weirdo's got a bizarrely good nose!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.400
Human, what is your name?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.640
Answer me, human!

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.870
Your name is important!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.110
This isn't the time!

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.490
All we need is the book.

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.250
Get him!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.650
Answer me, human!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.170
Kuro!

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:34.520
It's Kuro Daijuji!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:38.150
I'm not a mage, and I'm no hero either!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.190
I'm just a detective!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.290
I can't do anything about this, damn it!

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:46.030
Then Kuro Daijuji, I make a pact with you!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:54.400
<i>Kuro Daijuji, carve my
name into your heart.</i>

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:56.480
<i>My name is Al Azif...</i>

00:14:56.480 --> 00:15:02.050
<i>Written by Abdul Alhazred and
greatest of the world's grimoires!</i>

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:07.180
What are those two doing?

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.950
I-Impossible...

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:30.410
Al Azif chose a kid like that as her master!

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:32.570
Wh-What is this?

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.040
Right, where'd she go?

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.280
I'm right here.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.650
The pact was successful.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.650
You've gotten a lot smaller.

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:42.970
In exchange, your magical power

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:44.920
has been amplified immensely.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:50.930
Yes, now that you've been chosen
as the Al Azif grimoire's owner,

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.460
you're a mage, a Magius.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:56.130
Now fight with me!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.340
Don't decide these things without asking me!

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.870
More importantly, they're coming!

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.340
All right, then!

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.050
Yes?

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:15.950
You forgot this!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.490
Take it!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.800
What power...

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.810
Not bad for your first time.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:39.640
Your magic and mine seem to operate
on similar wavelengths!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:42.410
You said your name was Al Azif.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.980
What of it?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.050
That's the original version of
the grimoire <i>Necronomicon</i>.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:50.160
You know me?

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:53.400
The Black Lodge was chasing you
because you're a grimoire?

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.830
That's right.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.320
But what's with your appearance?

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.360
It's only natural that a grimoire like myself

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:02.370
would have a soul and physical form.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.860
I don't know how to respond to something

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.400
as crazy as that, said straight-faced.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.920
Anyway, you made a pact with me.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.440
I look forward to working
with you, Kuro Daijuji.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:13.430
Wait!

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:16.810
What do you mean, working with me?

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.780
Just what I said.

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:21.680
Why did this happen?

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:22.670
Fate.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:24.760
Don't sum it up in a single word!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.690
Wh-What?

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:42.580
Doctor West!

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:45.280
Terrified yet?

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.750
This is my true power...

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.940
Kuro Daijuji, was it?

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:55.170
The humiliation suffered by
the genius Doctor West

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.620
will be returned to you twice over,
and you can keep the change!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.690
Let's go!

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:13.340
I-I'm flying?

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.410
I'm flying, Al!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.440
Of course you are.

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.710
You're the ultimate mage, a Magius.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:21.810
That's...

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:25.450
Kuro Daijuji and Al Azif!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.080
Well? Did you see that?

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.170
This is my greatest masterpiece,

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:33.690
the Super West Invincible Robot 28 Special!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.560
Raika!

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.540
It's okay, everyone.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:41.030
Wh-What do we do?

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:43.760
Let's all stay calm and go to the shelter.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:46.040
I'm with you.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:50.140
I'll protect you all, so it's okay.

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.640
Okay!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.650
Now, disappear with the dust!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:01.070
That weirdo's going crazy down there.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.620
Hey, self-proclaimed ultimate grimoire!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.020
Can we do something about this?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:11.000
If I had my Deus Machina,
Aion, that pile of junk...

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:11.760
What?

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:20.100
Are you there, Aion?

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.220
No, it's something else.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.750
It's not Aion.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.410
But this feeling...

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.880
We're going down, Kuro!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:38.000
I'm sure of it.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.220
It's a Deus Machina.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:43.030
For me to find replacements
for my caster and Aion...

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.920
It's like someone is artificially
interfering with my fate.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:52.340
But in order to escape this threat,
let us follow this destiny.

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:55.100
Kuro, we're summoning a Deus Machina!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.900
Hey, what are you talking about?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:59.110
What's a Deus Machina?

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:01.530
What this world calls a god!

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:04.080
A god?

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:08.390
<i>I am the one who speaks
wisdom and weaves magic.</i>

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.610
<i>I am the howling of demons</i>

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.390
<i>and the mother of all my children,
for whom death may die.</i>

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:16.160
<i>In my name, Al Azif, I ask you...</i>

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.860
God, armored and wreathed in steel...

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.780
God, made by man's hand...

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.470
Mechanical god...

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:27.140
What is your name?

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:30.340
Demonbane?

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.550
A good name!

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:32.380
I like it!

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:38.010
<i>Then, Demonbane, by my name,
Al Azif, I summon you!</i>

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:56.670
Is it true that one of the Black Lodge's
Destroyer Robots has appeared?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:57.730
Mistress!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.680
Call me "Commander" here!

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:01.190
R-Right!

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.640
Commander, big trouble!

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:03.670
Demonbane has...

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.970
What happened to Demonbane?

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.780
It's booting up!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.810
What?

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:15.750
Perform an emergency shut down
on the Magical Energy Reactor.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.590
I tried, but... But it's not stopping!

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.710
This is impossible...

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.130
Where would such a massive
amount of current originate?

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:26.260
Demonbane, itself.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.880
High-density information, beyond our ability

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:32.240
to capture is circulating through
Demonbane's magical circuitry.

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:34.130
N-No...

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:37.110
Demonbane can't function without a grimoire.

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:39.450
Who's doing this and how?!

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:40.540
Commander!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:42.750
Demonbane's completed its boot up!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.200
Demonbane...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:50.490
My grandfather's Demonbane...

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.940
Demonbane is moving toward the
Imaginary Number Expansion Catapult.

00:21:56.940 --> 00:22:00.370
Magical Energy Reactor, conversion
systems, all online.

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:03.090
0.2 until critical point.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:04.220
0.1...

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.020
Final safety device released!

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:08.310
The Imaginary Number Expansion
Catapult is activating!

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.020
What is that?

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:43.770
Th-That's...

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:46.540
That is a Deus Machina.

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:48.280
Its name is Demonbane!

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:53.880
Demonbane...

00:24:35.730 --> 00:24:39.060
Does a hero become a hero at the moment of birth?

00:24:39.060 --> 00:24:44.030
No, a hero is one who follows a path
of spilled blood, with a will of steel.

00:24:44.030 --> 00:24:46.110
Next time: Evil Shine.

00:24:46.110 --> 00:24:50.030
Kuro Daijuji, what path will you follow?
